{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d","permalink_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/ArtifexSoftware:852bc74...ArtifexSoftware:d1f809e","diff_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","node_id":"C_kwDOD5mCPNoAKDg1MmJjNzQ2MDk5NWFjMjg1ZWVkZGVmNmE1MzZjZTE1OGE3MTEyMjc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ken Sharp","email":"Ken.Sharp@artifex.com","date":"2026-11-11T15:18:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Ken Sharp","email":"Ken.Sharp@artifex.com","date":"2026-11-11T15:18:52Z"},"message":"pdfwrite - Check indirect references to Actions for Launch actions\n\nBug #709818 \"pdfwrite PDF/A conversion skips Launch checks for indirect action dictionaries\"\n\nThe way that the PDF interpreter and pdfwrite interact here makes things\nquite difficult. We turn the original indirect refrence to the Action\ndictionary into a dictionary, and an indirect reference to it, back in\nthe PDF interpreter.\n\nThis preserves the original sense, but the way we do this, because of\npdfmark syntax is ludicrous. We end up creating a unique label,\nthen creating the Action dictionary as a local named object using that\nlabel. Then we refer to the named object from the Link annotation.\n\nSo to check an indirect object we need to reverse all that; we need to\nfind a given object number in the local (and potentially global)\nnamed object dictionary, then check that the object is a dictionary and\nfinally see if it has a /S key and a /Launch value.","tree":{"sha":"716de901e8a6309a8146f7b895729312a17ec359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/trees/716de901e8a6309a8146f7b895729312a17ec359"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/commits/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"9637d0d71bb78344efe654345103da4f4dd964cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/9637d0d71bb78344efe654345103da4f4dd964cb","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/9637d0d71bb78344efe654345103da4f4dd964cb"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d","node_id":"C_kwDOD5mCPNoAKGQxZjgwOWU0NmExYTg1NjRkMTVkOGIyNTAxMzE0YmYyMmI0MTJlN2Q","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ken Sharp","email":"Ken.Sharp@artifex.com","date":"2026-04-25T10:56:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"Chris Liddell","email":"chris.liddell@artifex.com","date":"2026-05-22T07:04:31Z"},"message":"PDF interprerter - guard spot function evaluation\n\nBug #709360 \"Stack-buffer-overflow in Ghostscript FunctionType 0 Halftone SpotFunction Evaluation\"\n\nWe shouldn't permit any function to return more than the maximum number\nof colourants.\n\nIn addition (not part of the bug report) we should check that a spot\nfunction is a 2-in,1-out function; that's the only kind permitted for\nspot functions.","tree":{"sha":"7c473281f3b2c652a64c34bd8046808df1b2ca4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/trees/7c473281f3b2c652a64c34bd8046808df1b2ca4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/commits/d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/d1f809e46a1a8564d15d8b2501314bf22b412e7d/comments","author":null,"committer":{"login":"chris-liddell","id":11627080,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjI3MDgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11627080?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-liddell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-liddell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e7aeab343a42b9662d64e9b50d78db47cda8831c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/e7aeab343a42b9662d64e9b50d78db47cda8831c","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/e7aeab343a42b9662d64e9b50d78db47cda8831c"}]},"status":"behind","ahead_by":0,"behind_by":270,"total_commits":0,"commits":[],"files":[]}